An all-in-one business community platform to serve all your workplace needs at Taikoo Place! Whether you’re scouting for programmes with energetic or soothing vibes, searching for new restaurants or latest happenings or wanting a seclusive space to work, the feature-packed Taikoo Place app is sure to deliver a convenient experience and spice up your workday with everything just a swipe away. 

Download now to:
- Find events & privileges for the office community;
- Enjoy hassle-free F&B experiences such as Grab & Go ordering & table booking;
- Discover workspaces & venues for your private work, meetings & business gatherings;
- Check taxi queues before you head down to the taxi stands around Taikoo Place

Learn more about Taikoo Place, one of Hong Kong’s best-planned business hubs: https://www.taikooplace.com/
